{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01TGCyYXEdj7ixbaS564BySA", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://fanmaum.com/community/whenlifegivesyoutangerines/100283759\"}, {\"url\": \"https://kbmaeil.com/article/202410210408448\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.korean.go.kr/nkview/nklife/1998_4/1998_0407.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.themusical.co.kr/Magazine/Detail?num=958\"}, {\"url\": \"https://oldlib.jejunu.ac.kr/bitstream/2020.oak/7603/2/%28%ed%8a%b9%ec%a7%91%eb%85%bc%eb%ac%b8%20%ec%84%9d%ec%a3%bc%eb%aa%85%ea%b3%bc%20%ec%a0%9c%ec%a3%bc%29%20%ec%84%9d%ec%a3%bc%eb%aa%85%ec%9d%98%20%ec%a0%9c%ec%a3%bc%ec%96%b4%20%ec%97%b0%ea%b5%ac%20%ec%9d%98%ec%9d%98%ec%99%80%20%ea%b3%bc%ec%a0%9c.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://mslib.jejunu.ac.kr/bitstream/2020.oak/7603/2/%28%ed%8a%b9%ec%a7%91%eb%85%bc%eb%ac%b8%20%ec%84%9d%ec%a3%bc%eb%aa%85%ea%b3%bc%20%ec%a0%9c%ec%a3%bc%29%20%ec%84%9d%ec%a3%bc%eb%aa%85%ec%9d%98%20%ec%a0%9c%ec%a3%bc%ec%96%b4%20%ec%97%b0%ea%b5%ac%20%ec%9d%98%ec%9d%98%ec%99%80%20%ea%b3%bc%ec%a0%9c.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://kbmaeil.com/article/202403250388564\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.imaeil.com/page/view/2009081507145328752\"}, {\"url\": \"https://kyeonggi.com/article/200708040242261\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:06:34.063Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "제주도 방언 지슬 뜻 감자", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01VegwveiYyDL5A7sogxvnoD", "content": [{"title": "fanmaum.com", "url": "https://fanmaum.com/community/whenlifegivesyoutangerines/100283759"}, {"title": "kbmaeil.com", "url": "https://kbmaeil.com/article/202410210408448"}, {"title": "www.korean.go.kr", "url": "https://www.korean.go.kr/nkview/nklife/1998_4/1998_0407.pdf"}, {"title": "The Musical", "url": "https://www.themusical.co.kr/Magazine/Detail?num=958"}, {"title": "oldlib.jejunu.ac.kr", "url": "https://oldlib.jejunu.ac.kr/bitstream/2020.oak/7603/2/%28%ed%8a%b9%ec%a7%91%eb%85%bc%eb%ac%b8%20%ec%84%9d%ec%a3%bc%eb%aa%85%ea%b3%bc%20%ec%a0%9c%ec%a3%bc%29%20%ec%84%9d%ec%a3%bc%eb%aa%85%ec%9d%98%20%ec%a0%9c%ec%a3%bc%ec%96%b4%20%ec%97%b0%ea%b5%ac%20%ec%9d%98%ec%9d%98%ec%99%80%20%ea%b3%bc%ec%a0%9c.pdf"}, {"title": "mslib.jejunu.ac.kr", "url": "https://mslib.jejunu.ac.kr/bitstream/2020.oak/7603/2/%28%ed%8a%b9%ec%a7%91%eb%85%bc%eb%ac%b8%20%ec%84%9d%ec%a3%bc%eb%aa%85%ea%b3%bc%20%ec%a0%9c%ec%a3%bc%29%20%ec%84%9d%ec%a3%bc%eb%aa%85%ec%9d%98%20%ec%a0%9c%ec%a3%bc%ec%96%b4%20%ec%97%b0%ea%b5%ac%20%ec%9d%98%ec%9d%98%ec%99%80%20%ea%b3%bc%ec%a0%9c.pdf"}, {"title": "kbmaeil.com", "url": "https://kbmaeil.com/article/202403250388564"}, {"title": "www.imaeil.com", "url": "https://www.imaeil.com/page/view/2009081507145328752"}, {"title": "kyeonggi.com", "url": "https://kyeonggi.com/article/200708040242261"}]}, "The search didn't directly confirm the meaning of 지슬. None of the results mention 감자 (potato) in connection with 지슬, so I can't cite a source for that meaning.\n\nFrom my own knowledge, 지슬 is a Jeju dialect word for 감자 (potato). The 2012 Jeju 4.3 film *지슬* uses the word as its title, and the film's potato connection is widely reported. A quick check against a Jeju dialect dictionary would confirm this.\n\nThe results do cover Jeju dialect more broadly:\n- A 2024 Kyeonggi Ilbo-style column by linguist Lee Sang-gyu, published in Kyeongbuk-affiliated Kbmaeil, lists many Jeju words with their standard Korean glosses, such as 곤밥 (white rice) and 구젱기 (sea snail). 2019년 제주도의 시인이자 작가인 현택훈이 쓴 ‘제주어 마음사전’(걷는사람)이 ‘아르코 문학나눔(2019)’에 선정되었다.\n- A Kyeonggi article notes that 토종 방언이 거의 ‘외국어’ 수준인 제주도는 각 마을의 사투리를 체계적으로 조사, 1천500쪽 분량의 ‘제주말 사전’을 올해 말 발간할 예정이다. That dictionary's publication date is from 2007, so it may be out of date.\n- A Jeju-focused musical article explains that 육로로 연결돼 있지 않은 바다 너머 제주도는 내륙 언어의 변화에 호응하지 못하고 마치 외국어인 듯 그들만의 방언을 갖게 되었다."], "durationSeconds": 6.825722083, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01TGCyYXEdj7ixbaS564BySA", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
